As outlined in the ((Mini-dictionary)) page, the selma'o of Lojban need to be divided up into paradigms which can be defined in a sitting by a given Lojbanist. This is a first cut of what those paradigms would be; obviously it is subject to refinement. Cover terms for the paradigms would be a good idea too... -- nitcion

